<title>GERMANY: Thyssen to build lift factory in Hungary.</title>
<headline>Thyssen to build lift factory in Hungary.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Thyssen Industrie AG said on Wednesdsay it plans to build a lift factory near the Hungarian capital of Budapest.</p>
<p>The plant in Kecskemet will later be expanded to serve the entire central and east European market, the company said.</p>
<p>The factory will be built on a plot Thyssen acquired two years ago, where it has already built one machinery plant.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
